namic Soundtrack:</strong> Cartoon-style graphics and immersive music bring the racing chaos to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: All features related to online/multiplayer modes are planned for future updates. Timelines will be announced to players accordingly.</i></p>","developers":["Heradon Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/header.jpg?t=1757079997","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3029090/1985350501/56400ea0d836cc9d481875e248e3c085738afa62/1750984891/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750986492","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3029090/1985350501/56400ea0d836cc9d481875e248e3c085738afa62/1750984891/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750986492","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3029090/1985350501/56400ea0d836cc9d481875e248e3c085738afa62/1750984891/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750986492","id":257162116,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162116/movie480.mp4?t=1750986492","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162116/movie_max.mp4?t=1750986492"},"name":"Fragment2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162116/a285378141e367f770020d51f5c55aca8f898db9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750986492","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162116/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750986492","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162116/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750986492"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3029090/829861/ad09eb73f2437239f6c00c4